1
00:00:00,853 --> 00:00:03,253
(Bernadette:)She's just excited
about the holidays.

2
00:00:03,255 --> 00:00:07,195
(Sheldon:)Yes, and she's not taking
my feelings into account at all.

3
00:00:07,193 --> 00:00:09,593
(Sheldon:)Maybe it's time
I teach her a lesson.

4
00:00:09,595 --> 00:00:11,265
(Bernadette:)How?

5
00:00:11,263 --> 00:00:15,463
(Sheldon:)Hmm. It'd have
to be something heinous,

6
00:00:15,468 --> 00:00:18,438
(Sheldon:)something that makes her
as miserable as she's making me.

7
00:00:18,437 --> 00:00:21,107
(Sheldon:)Oh, I've got it.

8
00:00:21,107 --> 00:00:22,237
(gasps)

9
00:00:22,241 --> 00:00:25,271
(Sheldon:)This is good.

10
00:00:25,277 --> 00:00:26,447
(Penny:)What?

11
00:00:26,445 --> 00:00:29,585
(Sheldon:)I'm going to buy her a present.

12
00:00:29,582 --> 00:00:33,582
(Bernadette:)Yeah, you're gonna
have to walk me through that.

13
00:00:33,586 --> 00:00:35,886
(Sheldon:)With gift-giving, there's
an implied social contract.

14
00:00:35,888 --> 00:00:37,418
(Sheldon:)If I show up

15
00:00:37,423 --> 00:00:40,123
(Sheldon:)tonight with a present,
and she doesn't have one for me,

16
00:00:40,126 --> 00:00:42,596
(Sheldon:)she'll feel terrible.

17
00:00:42,595 --> 00:00:45,095
(Bernadette:)Then you're both sad?

18
00:00:45,097 --> 00:00:47,327
(Sheldon:)Yes.

19
00:00:47,333 --> 00:00:48,433
(Sheldon:)Maybe she'll feel so guilty,

20
00:00:48,434 --> 00:00:50,804
(Sheldon:)she'll never make me celebrate
the holidays again.

21
00:00:50,803 --> 00:00:55,503
(Bernadette:)So your evil plot here is to buy
your girlfriend a present?

22
00:00:55,508 --> 00:00:57,438
(Sheldon:)That's right.

23
00:00:57,443 --> 00:01:02,023
(Sheldon:)So stay on my good side, or I'll
get you a little something, too.

